# Scratch space for local experiments: probe scripts, throwaway configs,
# screenshots, captured logs. Lives inside the repo on purpose -- nothing
# a working session produces should land outside it. The README is kept
# so the directory (and the rule) survives a fresh clone.
/tmp/*
!/tmp/README.md
